
# 2025-12-03 07:14:11.729293
+Code the following app
+```
+Battle Grid Game
+Game:
+A hidden tower battle on an 8x8 grid. You place 4 towers, AI places 4 towers. Take turns attacking squares to destroy all enemy towers first.
+
+Grid:
+
+8 rows × 8 columns
+
+64 total squares
+
+Coordinates: A1 to H8
+
+Game Flow:
+
+Setup Phase (30 seconds)
+
+Place your 4 towers on empty squares
+
+AI places 4 towers secretly. make sure the player can't see where the ai put there towers
+
+Battle Phase
+
+Your turn: Click any grid square to attack
+
+AI turn: AI attacks after 1-second delay
+
+Alternate turns
+
+Rules:
+
+Maximum 30 turns each
+
+Destroyed squares show as red
+
+Missed squares show as blue
+
+First to destroy 4 enemy towers wins
+
+UI Layout:
+
+Two 8x8 grids side by side
+
+Left grid: Your towers (defense)
+
+Right grid: Attack AI grid (offense)
+
+Top: Turn indicator and tower counters
+
+Bottom: Game controls
+
+Visual:
+
+Simple colored squares
+
+Green = Your tower (setup only)
+
+Blue = Miss
+
+Red = Hit
+
+Black = Destroyed tower
+
+Technical:
+
+HTML tables for grids
+
+JavaScript click handlers
+
+No external images
+
+Local game state only
+
+Works on mouse/touch
+
+Iteration 1:
+
+Build 8x8 grid layout
+
+Implement tower placement
+
+Add basic turn switching
+
+Iteration 2:
+
+Add attack logic
+
+Add win detection
+
+Add restart button
+
+Iteration 3:
+
+Add attack animations
+
+Add turn counter
+
+Add game status messages
+
+Iteration 4:
+
+Add sound effects
+
+Add game timer
+
+Add score tracking
+```
+
+Generate an app logo and update the app metadata title and description.

